# 4. Hash chain + Merkle root

Keep your existing per-run hash chain:

```text
E0
 ↓
H(E0)

E1 includes H(E0)
 ↓
H(E1)

E2 includes H(E1)
 ↓
H(E2)
```

This proves ordering and makes deletion/reordering evident.

Also calculate a Merkle root over all event digests when the run closes:

```text
           events_root
           /        \
        H01          H23
       /  \         /  \
      H0  H1       H2  H3
```

Then a marketplace buyer can request proof that:

```text
verification.completed
```

or:

```text
payment.settled
```

belongs to a receipt without downloading a huge private trajectory.

The **raw trace can remain secret** while inclusion of specific claims is provable.

