# 15. x402 is the invocation/payment rail

For:

> pay $1 and run this worker

use x402.

The current x402 v2 protocol separates:

```text
payment requirements
payment payload
verification
settlement
```

and its facilitator API exposes `/verify` and `/settle`. ([GitHub][15])

For EVM exact payments it uses authorization-based token transfers; its specification describes the EIP-712 authorization and settlement path. ([GitHub][16])

Make Moltwork generic:

```python
class PaymentProvider(Protocol):
    async def quote(...): ...
    async def verify(...): ...
    async def settle(...): ...
    async def refund(...): ...
```

Implementation:

```text
payments/x402.py
```

