← 402
   amount: 1 USDC
   network: Base
   ...

client pays

→ PAYMENT-SIGNATURE

Moltwork verifies

→ creates Invocation

→ launches TEE worker

→ returns artifact + WorkReceipt

→ settles

→ PaymentReceipt links tx
