buy dataset
```

Use ERC-8183 for:

```text
do this job
escrow $500
submit work
evaluator decides
release/refund
```

ERC-8183 defines:

```text
Open
  ↓
Funded
  ↓
Submitted
  ↓
Completed / Rejected / Expired
```

with client/provider/evaluator roles. ([Ethereum Improvement Proposals][17])

Mapping is extremely clean:

```text
ERC-8183                 Moltwork

jobId                →   WorkOrder.externalBinding
description          →   WorkOrder.spec
provider             →   Worker/owner
budget               →   economic ceiling
submit(deliverable)  →   WorkReceipt digest
complete(reason)     →   OutcomeReceipt
payment release      →   SettlementReceipt
```

I would make:

```text
deliverable = bytes32(work_receipt_digest)
```

and have the WorkReceipt itself reference all private/public artifacts.

That lets the on-chain job stay tiny.

