# 22. Evidence levels

Keep these explicit:

```text
P0 SELF_REPORTED

P1 RECORDED
WorkerKit structured event history.

P2 SIGNED
DSSE receipt with recognized signing identity.

P3 EXTERNALLY_VERIFIED
Independent verifier checked deliverable.

P4 OUTCOME_VERIFIED
External venue/payment/job outcome observed.

P5 TEE_ATTESTED
Exact approved execution environment attested.

P6 REEXECUTED
Independent deterministic/replay verification.

P7 ZK_VERIFIED
Specific cryptographic statement proven.
```

And importantly:

```text
TEE_ATTESTED
```

does **not** mean:

```text
the work was good
```

It means:

> approved code/environment produced the cryptographically bound execution evidence.

Quality still requires evaluator/outcome/re-execution.

